Model Elements are those conceptual entities and associated text that provide the structure of an ORM Diagram and a Model.
\par e.g. Entity Types, Value Types, Fact Types, Role Constraints and Model Notes are all Model Elements.
\par 
\par In Boston, any shape or text that can be viewed within a Page is a Model Element. Model Elements are, in effect, the 'elements' that go into the construction of a Model.
\par 
