Frequency Constraint Min/Max Error
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af1\afs20 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\fs20\insrsid2967002 
\par One or more Facts within the a Data Population of the Fact Type associated with the respective Frequency Constraint violates either the Minimum or Maximum allowed Fact count for that Frequency Constraint.
\par 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af1\afs26 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f1\fs26\insrsid2967002 Error Resolution
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af1\afs20 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\fs20\insrsid2967002 
\par To resolve this error do }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af1\afs20 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f1\fs20\insrsid2967002 one}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af1\afs20 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\fs20\insrsid2967002  of the following:
\par 
\par 1. Add or Remove Facts within the Fact Table (Data Population) of the Fact Type associated with the Frequency Constraint; }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af1\afs20 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f1\fs20\insrsid2967002 OR
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af1\afs20 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\fs20\insrsid2967002 2. Modify the Minimum and/or Maximum value counts of the Frequency Constraint as required.
\par 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af1\afs26 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f1\fs26\insrsid2967002 Example
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af1\afs20 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\fs20\insrsid2967002 
