Role Constraint has too few Role Sequences Error
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af1\afs20 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\fs20\insrsid2967002 
\par The Role Constraint associated with the Model Error has to few Role Sequences / Role Constraint Arguments.
\par 
\par This Model Error captures violations for multiple types of Role Constraints.
\par 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af1\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f1\fs22\insrsid2967002 Ring Constraints
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af1\afs20 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\fs20\insrsid2967002 
\par Each Ring Constraint must have two different Roles of the same Fact Type associated (linked to) the constraint, and where that Fact Type has two Roles played by the same Object Type.
\par If the Model Error is for a Ring Constraint, then that Ring Constraint has zero or one Role linked to the Ring Constraint.
\par 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af1\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f1\fs22\insrsid2967002 Other External Role Constraints
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af1\afs20 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\fs20\insrsid2967002 
\par Every External Role Constraint must have at least one associated Role.
\par 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af1\afs26 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f1\fs26\insrsid2967002 Error Resolution
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af1\afs20 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\fs20\insrsid2967002 
\par To resolve this error do the following:
\par 
\par 1. Make sure that the Role Constraint associated with the Model Error has the appropriate number of associated Roles for the Role Constraint and that each Role Constraint Argument of the Role Constraint has the required number of associated Roles.
\par 
