i
ble to make changes in an Entity Relationship Diagram and have those changes reflected within the corresponding ORM diagram as there is not enough information within the Entity Relationship Diagram to map back to the corresponding ORM diagram. However, an
y change within an ORM diagram can be reflected in its corresponding Entity Relationship Diagram.
\par 
\par }\pard\plain \ltrpar\s2\ql \li0\ri0\keepn\widctlpar\tx1200\wrapdefault\faauto\outlinelevel1\rin0\lin0\itap0 \rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af1\afs24\alang1025 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f1\fs24\ul\lang1252\langfe3081\cgrid\langnp1252\langfenp3081 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af1 \ltrch\fcs0 
