\par 
\par The Code Generator is template driven and can produce any text you desire from either a model in Boston or from the schema of a database. Text output may include }{\field{\*\fldinst {\rtlch\fcs1 \af1\afs20 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\fs20\insrsid2967002 HYPE
