\par 
\par The MetaModelConcept table has only one field called, 'Symbol', and stores a list of the Concepts/Symbols used in all Models within Boston.
\par 
\par Concepts instances within the Boston database accumulate over time with the development of Models. Periodically, Concepts no longer used by any Model in Boston should be removed from the database.
